WHY THIS REVISION AND NOT THE ONE THE SIBLING MARKETING SKILLS USE. This skill
did not exist upstream at 2026-03-04. It was created upstream at 2026-03-28
06:32 UTC and reached this project's source repository at 2026-03-28 10:53 UTC,
four hours later. Every revision of the upstream file was compared on
2026-09-04 and this one is the closest by a wide margin.

VERIFIED 2026-09-04 against that revision. references/source-guides.md
(13,188 bytes) is byte-identical.

TWO FILES DIFFER TRIVIALLY, and neither difference is a word.
  - SKILL.md: eight lines whose leading indentation is four spaces here and
    three spaces upstream. Identical word for word otherwise.
  - evals/evals.json: identical except that the bundled copy has no trailing
    newline, so it is one byte shorter.
Neither has a recorded cause. Both are the ordinary residue of a file copied
through an editor rather than cloned, and both are stated rather than rounded
away, because "byte-identical" is a claim and this is not one.

